WEBVTT

00:21.380 --> 00:22.750
(Ryeo Un)

00:24.080 --> 00:25.920
(Choi Hyun Wook)

00:28.019 --> 00:29.650
(Seol In Ah)

00:34.689 --> 00:36.630
(Shin Eun Soo)

00:44.170 --> 00:47.968
(Twinkling Watermelon)

00:47.969 --> 00:49.439
(Production sponsors)

00:49.440 --> 00:50.879
(Ministry of Culture, Sports and Tourism, KOCCA)

00:50.880 --> 00:51.880
(All people, organizations, locations, and incidents...)

00:51.880 --> 00:52.880
(in this drama are fictitious.)

00:52.880 --> 00:53.880
(Staff ensured child actors' safety in the filming of this drama.)

00:54.279 --> 00:56.549
One, two.

00:56.550 --> 00:58.749
One, two, three, four.

00:59.550 --> 01:01.450
(Episode 9)

01:13.329 --> 01:17.840
When I gaze at the setting sun, tinged with red

01:18.240 --> 01:21.470
The sad look on your face comes to my mind

01:21.869 --> 01:25.410
I sink my head, and tears fall down

01:25.640 --> 01:28.148
There's nothing I can say

01:28.149 --> 01:31.020
- But the truth is that I love you - But the truth is that I love you

01:31.679 --> 01:34.619
- You are my world - You are my world

01:35.289 --> 01:38.058
- I'm screaming that to the world - I'm screaming that to the world

01:38.059 --> 01:42.229
- But the setting sun burns silently - But the setting sun burns silently

01:42.860 --> 01:45.659
- The truth is that I love you - The truth is that I love you

01:45.660 --> 01:46.698
- Ha Eun Gyeol!
- Ha Eun Gyeol!

01:46.699 --> 01:49.329
- You are my world - You are my world

01:49.330 --> 01:50.330
- Ha Eun Gyeol!
- Ha Eun Gyeol!

01:50.331 --> 01:52.898
- I'm screaming that to the world - I'm screaming that to the world

01:52.899 --> 01:57.069
- But the setting sun burns silently - But the setting sun burns silently

01:58.910 --> 02:01.709
(Come back to us, Ha Eun Gyeol!)

02:09.149 --> 02:10.250
Welcome back, Eun Gyeol.

02:11.660 --> 02:13.020
I've been waiting for a long time.

02:14.160 --> 02:15.860
How did you know I was here?

02:16.190 --> 02:17.390
Se Gyeong told me.

02:21.030 --> 02:22.069
Eun Gyeol.

02:23.069 --> 02:24.400
I'm sorry.

02:26.139 --> 02:27.609
From now on, I'll do my best...

02:27.769 --> 02:29.739
for the band, to study,

02:30.139 --> 02:31.680
and to keep all of my promises to you.

02:33.009 --> 02:35.150
You might think you're wasting your time with me.

02:36.910 --> 02:38.250
But I'll try to make it worth your time.

02:39.079 --> 02:40.150
I'll do my best...

02:40.819 --> 02:42.419
not to waste your time and to improve.

02:44.019 --> 02:45.259
So come back to us.

02:46.460 --> 02:49.259
You're the only guitarist for First Love Memory Manipulators.

03:03.310 --> 03:04.979
- Fine. Let's do it.
- Really?

03:06.180 --> 03:08.578
You mean it, right? You can't back out now! Okay?

03:08.579 --> 03:11.078
- Under one condition.
- Yes. What is it?

03:11.079 --> 03:13.419
Tell me anything you want. I'll make it happen for you.

03:14.079 --> 03:15.350
Stop seeing Choi Se Gyeong.

03:19.389 --> 03:20.389
What?

03:23.859 --> 03:25.329
If you don't, we can't play together...

03:26.400 --> 03:27.430
because...

03:29.229 --> 03:30.229
Because?

03:31.169 --> 03:32.799
I like Choi Se Gyeong.

03:35.509 --> 03:37.680
(Come back to us, Ha Eun Gyeol!)

03:38.340 --> 03:39.380
So choose.

03:39.880 --> 03:41.079
Me or her?

03:48.650 --> 03:49.750
Answer me.

03:51.789 --> 03:52.819
I don't want to.

03:54.120 --> 03:56.060
- You don't want to?
- No.

03:57.359 --> 03:58.759
I don't want to choose, you jerk.

03:59.359 --> 04:00.400
What are you going to do?

04:01.870 --> 04:03.399
- They're fighting!
- They're going to fight!

04:03.400 --> 04:04.538
What did you say?

04:04.539 --> 04:06.039
- Hey, calm down.
- You want me to choose?

04:06.139 --> 04:07.299
- You want me to stop seeing her?
- Hey.

04:07.539 --> 04:09.309
- What are you doing?
- You like whom?

04:09.310 --> 04:11.008
- Hey, come here.
- Let go of him.

04:11.009 --> 04:12.339
You had no place to go!

04:12.340 --> 04:14.909
I gave you clothes, food, and a place to sleep! Darn it.

04:14.910 --> 04:16.649
How could you stab me in the back like this?

04:16.650 --> 04:19.819
Hey, how could you do this to me?

04:19.979 --> 04:21.448
How could you?

04:21.449 --> 04:23.819
The food wasn't from you. Your grandma fed me!

04:24.989 --> 04:27.460
- What did you say, you jerk?
- I'm doing this for you!

04:27.660 --> 04:29.590
I'm doing it for your own good!

04:31.600 --> 04:33.660
Okay. Bal San, okay.

04:34.030 --> 04:35.570
- Okay.
- Gosh.

04:36.770 --> 04:37.799
I'm really okay.

04:39.299 --> 04:41.269
- Hey!
- Hey, stop it.

04:41.270 --> 04:42.569
You're going to betray me and then do me a favor?

04:42.570 --> 04:43.868
- You think this is a joke?
- Hey.

04:43.869 --> 04:45.840
- Hey, that's enough.
- Get your hands off me!

04:48.210 --> 04:49.580
Yi Chan, are you all right?

04:50.049 --> 04:51.379
Are you hurt badly?

04:55.520 --> 04:57.349
- Hey, his nose is bleeding.
- Oh, no.

04:57.350 --> 04:58.918
- You got a nosebleed.
- It's a nosebleed.

04:58.919 --> 05:00.919
- Both of his nostrils are bleeding.
- Yi Chan!

05:01.429 --> 05:04.029
Are you all right? Oh, no. You got a nosebleed! This is bad.

05:04.030 --> 05:05.400
Does it hurt a lot?

05:05.830 --> 05:07.460
What do you think, you jerk?

05:16.510 --> 05:17.570
Let go of me!

05:35.760 --> 05:37.929
Stop it. Please that's enough!

05:39.929 --> 05:40.960
Hey, it's Choi Se Gyeong!

05:41.530 --> 05:43.600
- Hey, let's go.
- It's Choi Se Gyeong!

05:44.200 --> 05:45.368
My cap!

05:45.369 --> 05:47.270
- Hey, Se Gyeong.
- Oh, no!

05:47.970 --> 05:49.668
- Hey!
- Hey, it's her.

05:49.669 --> 05:51.840
- Se Gyeong.
- What's going on?

06:01.320 --> 06:03.489
- Hey, get on that.
- Get on that already.

06:04.049 --> 06:06.619
- Hey, hop on.
- Hurry up.

06:06.859 --> 06:08.759
- Get on it.
- Hey, where are you going?

06:08.760 --> 06:09.889
Darn it. Hurry up!

06:09.890 --> 06:11.228
We need to settle this!

06:11.229 --> 06:12.830
Come on. Get on the truck already!

06:13.760 --> 06:14.799
Hurry up.

06:15.400 --> 06:16.770
Look who it is.

06:17.700 --> 06:18.939
I recognize you.

06:22.539 --> 06:25.609
Darn it. People will recognize me without the cap.

06:36.820 --> 06:39.320
Move! Hey, stop right there!

06:53.999 --> 06:55.039
- Hurry.
- Hey.

06:55.809 --> 06:57.369
- Come on. Hop on it.
- Hey.

07:01.850 --> 07:02.850
Wait.

07:04.510 --> 07:06.879
- Hey!
- Grab my hand!

07:18.200 --> 07:19.229
Okay.

07:58.840 --> 08:00.070
(Outdoor swimming pool)

08:10.379 --> 08:11.549
These punks.

08:12.150 --> 08:13.150
Where are they?

08:13.450 --> 08:14.450
Are they here?

08:34.570 --> 08:35.939
- Are you okay?
- Darn it.

08:36.369 --> 08:39.009
What is this? What do you think you're doing?

08:39.010 --> 08:41.079
It looked like you were in a tight spot...

08:41.080 --> 08:42.509
like you didn't want the school to know you were here.

08:42.510 --> 08:44.548
- I was just trying to help.
- Not that.

08:44.549 --> 08:45.619
Not that?

08:47.989 --> 08:49.989
I'm sorry about earlier.

08:50.450 --> 08:53.019
It wasn't nice of me to share my feelings in front of everyone.

08:53.560 --> 08:54.959
I would like to apologize politely.

08:54.960 --> 08:57.289
That's a form of violence. Did you know that?

08:57.290 --> 08:58.399
I'm sorry.

09:00.830 --> 09:02.629
I'll accept your apology. Go on.

09:03.769 --> 09:04.999
Is there more?

09:09.210 --> 09:10.539
How I said I liked you?

09:10.540 --> 09:12.878
Yes. That! There's no way you actually have feelings for me.

09:12.879 --> 09:15.350
Are you kidding me? You like Yi Chan, not me.

09:15.550 --> 09:16.579
How many times...

09:16.580 --> 09:17.850
- must I say that's not true?
- Shut your mouth!

09:18.050 --> 09:19.878
You used me as your beard, so you wouldn't get outed.

09:19.879 --> 09:21.388
You used me like a tool to pretend...

09:21.389 --> 09:22.618
you like girls.

09:22.619 --> 09:24.319
I'm your protection like the airbag.

09:24.320 --> 09:26.690
You used me as a bulletproof vest to lie like a coward.

09:26.720 --> 09:28.060
It's impossible to win an argument against her.

09:28.389 --> 09:29.889
Ms. Choi was a modern woman.

09:29.960 --> 09:31.800
Do you realize what you have done wrong?

09:31.899 --> 09:33.228
My mission starts now.

09:33.229 --> 09:34.398
It wasn't a lie. I meant it.

09:34.399 --> 09:35.898
I really like you a lot.

09:35.899 --> 09:38.569
So if possible, I hope you like me back and become very fond of me.

09:38.570 --> 09:41.670
What's this? It feels like I'm talking to an AI.

09:41.840 --> 09:44.879
What's this? It feels like I'm being examined under the microscope.

09:45.210 --> 09:46.279
Did she figure it out?

09:46.940 --> 09:48.180
I'll give you three seconds.

09:48.249 --> 09:49.579
Tell me why you like me...

09:49.580 --> 09:51.478
and when you started to like me in these given three seconds.

09:51.479 --> 09:52.549
It's a ten-point open-ended question.

09:52.550 --> 09:53.550
Unless you want to die,

09:53.551 --> 09:55.290
you'd better give me an answer as wise as Solomon's solution.

09:55.489 --> 09:57.089
- One.
- I'm in trouble.

09:57.090 --> 09:58.090
What should I say?

09:58.389 --> 09:59.389
Two.

09:59.390 --> 10:00.659
It looks like she's ready to kill me.

10:01.019 --> 10:02.889
If I say the wrong thing, I really might end up dead.

10:04.659 --> 10:06.258
- Three.
- It was the first time I saw you.

10:06.259 --> 10:07.330
It was like fate.

10:07.930 --> 10:09.070
You were too pretty.

10:11.470 --> 10:13.869
I'm doomed. It won't work, right?

10:14.639 --> 10:15.639
Mission clear.

10:15.640 --> 10:17.070
What? This worked?

10:17.909 --> 10:19.009
You punk.

10:20.509 --> 10:21.879
You have real feelings for me.

10:21.979 --> 10:23.749
What? Why was that so easy?

10:24.050 --> 10:25.379
Was she really the queen of the school?

10:25.920 --> 10:27.019
Oh, my.

10:28.489 --> 10:30.989
I see. You were in here.

10:31.720 --> 10:33.619
You punks.

10:39.700 --> 10:42.269
How am I supposed to understand this?

10:43.269 --> 10:44.700
This is your first day at school.

10:45.070 --> 10:46.398
Yet, you brought in students from another school...

10:46.399 --> 10:48.909
and fought over a girl. Talk about some recklessness.

10:49.310 --> 10:50.970
You were supposed to be studying abroad.

10:51.170 --> 10:52.439
Why are you standing...

10:52.440 --> 10:54.540
in my office with this troublemaker?

10:55.649 --> 10:56.850
- I'm sorry.
- I'm sorry.

10:57.479 --> 10:58.720
Do you know each other?

10:59.050 --> 11:00.180
- No.
- Yes.

11:01.279 --> 11:02.290
What are you doing?

11:04.989 --> 11:06.060
- Yes.
- No.

11:07.359 --> 11:08.629
- Gosh.
- What?

11:10.989 --> 11:12.029
Is this funny?

11:13.200 --> 11:14.300
Do you think this is a joke?

11:17.800 --> 11:18.998
(Seowon Arts High School)

11:18.999 --> 11:21.300
The bell rang. Go back to your class for now.

11:21.639 --> 11:22.639
As for what happened today,

11:23.369 --> 11:24.939
based on the decision of the Guidance Committee,

11:24.940 --> 11:26.940
you'll face appropriate punishment. That's all.

11:27.710 --> 11:28.710
Okay.

11:30.609 --> 11:31.850
Se Gyeong, you stay.

11:33.320 --> 11:34.719
- Really?
- No way.

11:34.720 --> 11:36.249
- Are you sure?
- Seriously?

11:42.489 --> 11:44.060
Sorry. I'm late.

11:46.600 --> 11:47.628
Chung Ah.

11:47.629 --> 11:49.769
- What's going on?
- Hey, what's happening?

11:49.930 --> 11:51.738
- What was that?
- Is there a love triangle?

11:51.739 --> 11:52.840
- Oh, no.
- Look.

11:55.869 --> 11:56.970
So let me get this straight.

11:57.540 --> 12:00.609
You started to hear ringing in your ears all of a sudden.

12:01.710 --> 12:02.849
The local doctor said...

12:02.850 --> 12:04.148
it was probably because of your long flight...

12:04.149 --> 12:05.720
and was only temporary.

12:05.950 --> 12:08.488
But you came back to Korea to get a thorough medical exam...

12:08.489 --> 12:10.090
just in case. Did I get it right?

12:10.249 --> 12:11.249
Yes.

12:11.690 --> 12:13.889
Ma'am, you know how my mom is.

12:14.060 --> 12:16.829
Even the smallest thing worries her.

12:16.830 --> 12:18.229
Yes! That's it.

12:18.460 --> 12:21.570
Gosh. I can never get my way with my stubborn mother.

12:21.670 --> 12:24.670
But why would someone like her allow you to travel alone?

12:25.700 --> 12:26.899
Well,

12:27.739 --> 12:29.469
I have my uncle here.

12:29.470 --> 12:31.738
I'll get examined at his hospital.

12:31.739 --> 12:32.810
That’s why they let me come to Korea alone.

12:33.080 --> 12:34.680
- Is that so?
- Yes.

12:34.879 --> 12:36.478
I'm glad to hear that you have someone looking after you.

12:36.479 --> 12:37.509
Right.

12:38.080 --> 12:39.080
Go ahead.

12:46.489 --> 12:48.690
Good grief. Is she a profiler or what?

12:48.930 --> 12:50.690
She's making me super nervous. Seriously.

12:52.529 --> 12:55.369
Then does it mean you will postpone your studies abroad?

12:55.629 --> 12:57.998
No. I just have to pass the language course.

12:57.999 --> 13:00.239
I can go back to the US before the master course begins.

13:00.739 --> 13:01.739
I see.

13:08.879 --> 13:10.180
I hope you won't take it personally.

13:10.580 --> 13:12.550
It's not that I don't believe you.

13:12.979 --> 13:15.290
I'm just trying to fulfill my duty.

13:15.720 --> 13:17.820
Gosh. Are you going to call them?

13:18.560 --> 13:20.959
My parents are traveling in Canada right now.

13:20.960 --> 13:22.259
They won't answer their phones.

13:25.100 --> 13:26.330
Go and drink your tea.

13:27.859 --> 13:30.670
This is bad. What if Mom answers the phone?

13:31.129 --> 13:33.940
My family is traveling Canada right now.

13:33.999 --> 13:35.368
- Nice!
- If you need to reach us,

13:35.369 --> 13:38.210
- please leave a message.
- Good job remembering that.

13:39.109 --> 13:42.109
Let's talk again once your parents come back from their trip.

13:43.249 --> 13:44.978
I'll arrange things at school,

13:44.979 --> 13:46.920
so you can attend our school before you have to go back.

13:47.580 --> 13:50.220
What? Why must I come back?

13:50.790 --> 13:52.189
You don't have to do that.

13:52.190 --> 13:53.259
You.

13:57.729 --> 13:58.960
Are you Choi Se Gyeong?

13:59.930 --> 14:00.960
What?

14:02.129 --> 14:03.999
What do you mean?

14:04.229 --> 14:06.299
An ordinary girl who doesn't feel bad about...

14:06.300 --> 14:07.869
wasting her youth would have that attitude.

14:08.810 --> 14:10.540
But the Choi Se Gyeong I know...

14:10.869 --> 14:12.909
would want the same thing as me.

14:13.580 --> 14:16.210
Isn't that why you came to school?

14:18.009 --> 14:20.879
Bingo! You're the best.

14:21.889 --> 14:23.090
We're on the same page.

14:25.359 --> 14:28.189
Darn it. Why do I have to go to school in 1995?

14:28.190 --> 14:29.759
After all, I time traveled here.

14:36.999 --> 14:38.070
Chung Ah.

14:38.540 --> 14:40.070
Don't be mad at me, please.

14:40.970 --> 14:42.639
Why don't you hit me instead?

14:42.869 --> 14:44.409
Use your anger to hit me.

14:44.940 --> 14:46.210
Hit me...

14:46.540 --> 14:47.940
until you feel better. Okay?

14:48.139 --> 14:50.379
Please forgive me just this once.

14:50.479 --> 14:51.978
Please. Just this once.

14:51.979 --> 14:53.649
What's his deal?

14:54.450 --> 14:57.049
He told the entire school he liked me. How can he act like that?

14:57.050 --> 14:58.119
Please don't be angry.

14:58.619 --> 15:00.820
Please, Chung Ah. Just this once.

15:21.710 --> 15:23.050
Assume the position again.

15:27.350 --> 15:28.850
How could you barge in there?

15:29.920 --> 15:31.720
Did you go there to disgrace our school?

15:32.460 --> 15:35.729
You ought to carry on with your failed lives quietly.

15:35.790 --> 15:38.498
Why did you make a scene in our entire district...

15:38.499 --> 15:40.159
like loaches mudding the water, you punks?

15:42.470 --> 15:44.700
You're the problem. You know?

15:44.930 --> 15:47.199
Since you gave up on going to college,

15:47.200 --> 15:48.540
you don't care. Is that it?

15:49.269 --> 15:50.969
Are you doing whatever you want because you have no parents,

15:50.970 --> 15:52.540
fretting over you?

15:57.149 --> 15:58.680
- Gosh, look at this punk.
- Hey.

15:58.950 --> 16:00.080
Get back on the floor.

16:01.619 --> 16:03.690
Goodness. You little...

16:06.259 --> 16:07.389
Sir,

16:09.930 --> 16:11.359
doesn't your right arm hurt?

16:11.859 --> 16:13.659
I've been worried about your arm for a while now.

16:13.830 --> 16:16.299
You know what? Right here. I'll do it here.

16:16.300 --> 16:17.769
I'll switch sides.

16:18.170 --> 16:19.340
You can use your left arm.

16:20.869 --> 16:22.009
I love you!

16:22.540 --> 16:24.768
I do think I only used my right arm.

16:24.769 --> 16:25.979
Thank you, you punk.

16:27.580 --> 16:29.179
I can easily find it

16:29.180 --> 16:31.049
- It's in my heart - It's in my heart

16:31.050 --> 16:32.778
I'll know when I close my eyes...

16:32.779 --> 16:33.978
And think quietly

16:33.979 --> 16:36.050
Hey. My part still didn't come up?

16:36.690 --> 16:39.460
- I roam around to find an angel - I roam around to find an angel

16:41.619 --> 16:44.229
Oh, my. Look at you brooding.

16:44.659 --> 16:46.359
Why? Is it because you feel betrayed?

16:46.529 --> 16:49.269
Or did you get your heart broken? Is that it?

16:49.499 --> 16:51.499
Se Gyeong never betrayed me.

16:52.100 --> 16:53.670
Therefore, she never broke my heart.

16:54.139 --> 16:56.210
I never said she was the one who hurt you.

16:57.310 --> 16:58.540
You probably feel...

16:59.109 --> 17:01.949
as if Ha Eun Gyeol betrayed you and broke your heart.

17:01.950 --> 17:03.009
Do you want to die?

17:03.350 --> 17:04.748
By the way, isn't it odd?

17:04.749 --> 17:05.919
The way Ha Eun Gyeol acted earlier.

17:05.920 --> 17:06.978
Shut your mouth.

17:06.979 --> 17:09.389
He was saying things that could hurt your feelings.

17:09.749 --> 17:11.790
But from the way he gazed at you, he was totally on your side.

17:14.420 --> 17:16.089
I did it for you.

17:16.090 --> 17:18.260
I did it for you.

17:19.159 --> 17:20.458
Anyway,

17:20.459 --> 17:22.929
choose between Se Gyeong and Eun Gyeol.

17:23.199 --> 17:26.639
For your information, if Eun Gyeol is out, I'm dropping out too.

17:27.540 --> 17:28.570
What?

17:31.909 --> 17:35.979
- I know how it feels to be alone - I know how it feels to be alone

17:35.980 --> 17:39.178
- I was mistaken - I was mistaken

17:39.179 --> 17:43.249
Can you feel that the beginning of love

17:43.250 --> 17:45.819
Is the end of loneliness?

17:45.820 --> 17:48.118
I know now

17:48.119 --> 17:49.859
Chung Ah.

17:52.830 --> 17:54.159
What has been bothering you since earlier?

17:55.369 --> 17:56.669
What's the matter?

17:56.770 --> 17:58.000
What did I do wrong?

18:00.570 --> 18:01.639
Chung Ah.

18:03.240 --> 18:04.939
Chung Ah.

18:09.310 --> 18:11.280
You have serious separation anxiety.

18:11.580 --> 18:13.418
Woof. Are you a dog?

18:13.419 --> 18:14.618
Do you like anyone as long as they're a human?

18:14.619 --> 18:16.589
Men or women. Does it not matter at all?

18:16.590 --> 18:18.319
I think you're mistaken.

18:18.320 --> 18:20.789
- Chung Ah and I are not...
- Of course, you're not.

18:20.790 --> 18:22.458
Follow me. We should go somewhere.

18:22.459 --> 18:24.689
I'm sorry, but I can't go today.

18:24.830 --> 18:27.530
You do? I should meet Yi Chan then.

18:28.770 --> 18:29.770
Yi Chan?

18:30.429 --> 18:32.540
Hey. Gosh.

18:34.800 --> 18:37.070
(Spicy Jokbal)

18:38.679 --> 18:41.340
Why do you want me to eat this so badly?

18:42.850 --> 18:43.850
You said you liked me.

18:43.851 --> 18:47.378
What does it have to do with this lump of capsaicin?

18:47.379 --> 18:49.289
Hey. Did I tell you to pick a star...

18:49.290 --> 18:51.218
or ask you to be buried together when I die?

18:51.219 --> 18:53.060
You can't even eat this jokbal for me?

18:56.290 --> 18:58.159
Why? Do you not want to do it?

18:58.490 --> 18:59.730
Can you not eat it because it's spicy?

19:00.000 --> 19:01.060
How should I eat it?

19:02.399 --> 19:03.468
What?

19:03.469 --> 19:05.399
You said it was important and your life was at stake.

19:06.340 --> 19:08.100
It seems you're not entirely joking.

19:09.609 --> 19:11.069
Just because it looks trivial to me,

19:11.070 --> 19:13.310
I shouldn't ignore that someone is desperate.

19:15.179 --> 19:18.050
I know how it feels when you have your reasons but can't say them.

19:22.020 --> 19:23.119
How should I eat it?

19:23.649 --> 19:25.490
Should I eat it well or badly?

19:26.959 --> 19:28.830
I'll do my best to do as you want.

19:30.590 --> 19:31.590
Eat it well.

19:33.699 --> 19:36.070
No. Eat it badly.

19:37.399 --> 19:38.469
Not badly.

19:39.070 --> 19:42.510
But not well. Darn it.

19:42.909 --> 19:44.769
I don't know. Do as you want.

19:44.770 --> 19:46.409
Okay. I'll do as I want.

19:50.409 --> 19:51.480
Wait.

20:01.419 --> 20:04.730
Don't eat for now.

20:05.530 --> 20:08.359
Excuse me. Could you pack this for me, please?

20:13.340 --> 20:14.340
Oh, my gosh.

20:15.510 --> 20:16.540
Hey.

20:16.709 --> 20:18.139
Why? What?

20:18.840 --> 20:21.010
When can I hear your answer?

20:21.409 --> 20:23.780
Answer? What answer?

20:27.480 --> 20:28.949
The answer to my confession.

20:31.790 --> 20:34.119
I want to know what you think about me.

20:34.659 --> 20:38.559
There used to be a handsome and cute dog...

20:38.560 --> 20:39.760
in my neighborhood.

20:40.129 --> 20:43.428
A dog that was a mix of Shiba Inu and Siberian Husky.

20:43.429 --> 20:45.029
(Shiba Inu, Siberian Husky)

20:45.030 --> 20:46.100
And?

20:47.600 --> 20:48.810
You two look alike.

20:49.169 --> 20:51.070
What do you mean?

20:51.469 --> 20:53.079
Does it mean I'm cute or handsome?

20:53.080 --> 20:54.080
Shiba Sky.

20:54.679 --> 20:55.679
"Shiba?"

20:55.680 --> 20:59.378
You're nothing more than or less than Shiba Sky.

20:59.379 --> 21:01.080
So just wait.

21:01.179 --> 21:04.049
Before I decide whether I...

21:04.050 --> 21:05.219
should give you a snack or not.

21:08.459 --> 21:09.560
This is so difficult.

21:10.260 --> 21:11.929
I don't get what she said at all.

21:12.730 --> 21:14.699
"Siberian Husky?" Did she just sweat at me?

21:21.369 --> 21:22.810
What are you, Eun Yu?

21:24.169 --> 21:26.480
It's not a big deal. Why are you hesitating, not being able to check?

21:31.080 --> 21:32.080
But wait.

21:32.580 --> 21:34.780
How much someone can handle spicy food is relative, isn't it?

21:34.980 --> 21:36.089
Who is the standard?

21:36.090 --> 21:37.689
How well does he have to eat it?

21:37.790 --> 21:40.059
If you think like that, Hyun Yul who gobbled spicy chicken feet...

21:40.060 --> 21:41.419
should be a candidate as well. Don't you think so?

21:44.060 --> 21:45.329
Goodness gracious.

21:45.330 --> 21:47.500
Why did Mom give me such a bad hint?

21:47.830 --> 21:49.229
Darn it.

21:49.230 --> 21:51.699
That's when I thought it was him.

21:52.770 --> 21:53.839
When?

21:53.840 --> 21:54.869
During the spring festival.

21:55.969 --> 21:57.468
That day,

21:57.469 --> 22:00.139
he sang a serenade for me on stage at the festival.

22:02.379 --> 22:03.849
I heard you guys ask whether it was falling in love at once...

22:03.850 --> 22:04.879
or falling in love slowly.

22:06.119 --> 22:09.050
I think it was slow for me.

22:09.550 --> 22:11.750
It was slow as if I were soaked in drizzle.

22:13.619 --> 22:15.219
Then I fell in love at once that day.

22:17.689 --> 22:20.459
"I must like this guy."

22:20.859 --> 22:23.570
"No. Maybe I've been liking him all this while."

22:25.899 --> 22:28.070
"There would be no exit."

22:29.639 --> 22:31.510
It was like an "accident" as you say.

22:32.340 --> 22:33.438
Right.

22:33.439 --> 22:36.080
I wasn't swayed by Eun Gyeol at all.

22:36.280 --> 22:40.020
I just had a more certain standard hidden here.

22:40.480 --> 22:43.188
I got it. Between Yi Chan and Eun Gyeol,

22:43.189 --> 22:46.218
the one who sings a serenade at the festival is Mom's first love.

22:46.219 --> 22:48.118
And I should just watch both of them,

22:48.119 --> 22:49.230
leaving room for possibilities until then.

22:50.560 --> 22:52.730
Secretly and fairly.

22:55.669 --> 22:56.699
Let's start the lesson.

22:59.199 --> 23:01.300
What's wrong with you?

23:01.469 --> 23:03.468
I just said, "Let's start the lesson" as soon as I came.

23:03.469 --> 23:04.669
Is that something that makes you angry like this?

23:10.280 --> 23:14.020
Why are my parents doing this to me?

23:14.320 --> 23:15.990
What did I do wrong?

23:21.560 --> 23:24.859
(If I hadn't lent the T-shirt to Se Gyeong...)

23:25.490 --> 23:27.230
(Se Gyeong left. Do you know that? I hope you're not too sad.)

23:27.760 --> 23:28.800
Does she...

23:29.100 --> 23:30.398
(I ran for a long time, holding your hand.)

23:30.399 --> 23:31.669
(I was running out of breath, dizzy, and my heart was pounding.)

23:32.439 --> 23:33.469
Does she...

23:34.240 --> 23:36.168
(This is my fax number.)

23:36.169 --> 23:37.510
(Ha Yi Chan)

23:38.810 --> 23:39.879
A heart?

23:44.909 --> 23:45.949
Do you...

23:46.850 --> 23:48.449
like Yi Chan, Mom?

23:50.990 --> 23:52.089
Hold on.

23:52.090 --> 23:54.389
Let me ask you just one question.

24:00.730 --> 24:02.899
Mom. Let me ask you just one question.

24:03.070 --> 24:04.230
Just once.

24:08.100 --> 24:09.939
Mom had a crush on Dad.

24:13.010 --> 24:15.539
If I had known it, I would've planned another strategy.

24:15.540 --> 24:17.879
I provoked Dad for no reason.

24:18.919 --> 24:20.080
I'm screwed.

24:26.760 --> 24:27.889
(Restaurant Waryong)

24:28.859 --> 24:31.790
(Restaurant Waryong)

24:58.119 --> 25:00.320
You came? Don't get intimidated and take a seat.

25:00.889 --> 25:02.629
I'm not going to kill you yet.

25:10.800 --> 25:11.928
Why did you open it?

25:11.929 --> 25:14.540
You said you would put it there just to intimidate him.

25:15.369 --> 25:18.139
Darn it. It's open.

25:20.209 --> 25:21.310
Are you in choir?

25:21.480 --> 25:23.379
Why are you standing like that? You're so distracting.

25:28.350 --> 25:29.918
- Sir.
- What?

25:29.919 --> 25:30.949
A double serving of jjajangmyeon, please.

25:31.250 --> 25:33.790
A double serving of jjajangmyeon only? I'm getting mad.

25:34.520 --> 25:36.429
Why am I so unlucky?

26:15.459 --> 26:17.399
I thought long and hard all night.

26:18.330 --> 26:21.070
All the weird things you've done so far.

26:21.740 --> 26:24.010
When you told me that you liked Se Gyeong,

26:24.469 --> 26:25.909
everything clicked.

26:27.080 --> 26:29.550
I do owe you an apology.

26:30.250 --> 26:31.280
So...

26:31.409 --> 26:33.279
today, I shall kindly put myself in your feet and...

26:33.280 --> 26:35.519
You mean, you'll put yourself in my shoes? Gosh, seriously.

26:35.520 --> 26:36.618
Shut it...

26:36.619 --> 26:37.888
before I stitch your lips together!

26:37.889 --> 26:39.958
- Don't.
- Sit back down.

26:39.959 --> 26:41.119
Sit down.

26:43.830 --> 26:47.030
Fine. I shall put myself in your shoes and tear you limb from limb...

26:50.230 --> 26:51.300
Anyway,

26:51.600 --> 26:53.868
I have a proposal you can't refuse.

26:53.869 --> 26:55.770
A proposal? What is it?

26:55.869 --> 26:59.439
I won't tell you not to see Se Gyeong,

27:00.209 --> 27:03.050
so I don't want to hear such nonsense from you either.

27:03.649 --> 27:04.980
We'll make a truce for the time being.

27:05.310 --> 27:07.520
That way, we can focus solely on the band before the festival.

27:08.379 --> 27:09.388
Deal?

27:09.389 --> 27:11.790
This is my chance. How am I going to seize this opportunity?

27:11.919 --> 27:14.060
Why? You don't like my idea? You can't do it?

27:14.520 --> 27:15.559
Forget it, then.

27:15.560 --> 27:17.189
How about we don't see her at all?

27:18.030 --> 27:19.559
Let's keep it fair between us.

27:19.560 --> 27:21.500
So both of us shouldn't see her until the school festival.

27:21.760 --> 27:22.770
Instead,

27:23.369 --> 27:25.330
our performance at the festival will decide the winner.

27:26.939 --> 27:27.939
What do you say?

27:33.780 --> 27:36.678
I guess you don't know how much I've improved...

27:36.679 --> 27:37.879
since you were gone.

27:38.149 --> 27:39.520
Am I the only one hearing this for the first time?

27:39.679 --> 27:40.719
Well...

27:41.350 --> 27:44.290
The ball is now in Se Gyeong's court anyway.

27:44.490 --> 27:45.858
And she said she'd make her decision...

27:45.859 --> 27:47.859
once she watched us perform at the festival,

27:48.619 --> 27:50.059
so Yi Chan has nothing to lose.

27:50.060 --> 27:51.128
You heard that?

27:51.129 --> 27:52.259
I mean,

27:52.260 --> 27:54.858
not being able to see her for the time being will make me sad,

27:54.859 --> 27:57.499
but this could be fatal to you. Will you be all right?

27:57.500 --> 28:00.969
Gosh. How should your brain be wired to come up with such an answer?

28:01.300 --> 28:03.438
So? Do we have a deal?

28:03.439 --> 28:06.080
Yes, deal!

28:09.209 --> 28:10.550
He bit the bait.

28:11.010 --> 28:14.080
(20 Years of Excellence, Traditional Chinese Cuisine)

28:16.050 --> 28:18.149
As you know, we don't have much time left until the festival.

28:19.490 --> 28:21.819
But they say, after a rainy day, the soil... Anyway,

28:21.820 --> 28:22.959
we can pull this off.

28:23.389 --> 28:24.859
- Let's go.
- With that said,

28:25.060 --> 28:26.129
how about a cheer?

28:29.030 --> 28:30.129
How come I only see two hands?

28:32.369 --> 28:34.270
Darn it, seriously. Hey!

28:40.980 --> 28:41.980
What?

28:45.480 --> 28:47.020
So you now work for the Jinsung Family as a live-in tutor?

28:48.750 --> 28:49.750
Why are you surprised?

28:50.350 --> 28:51.719
Don't you know how fast rumors can travel?

28:52.219 --> 28:53.619
I heard some things, so I know that much.

28:53.820 --> 28:56.030
Well, what happened was...

28:56.129 --> 28:58.989
I met the chairman of Jinsung by chance, and he offered help.

28:58.990 --> 29:00.030
You don't need to explain.

29:00.560 --> 29:01.799
Of course, it's much better for you...

29:01.800 --> 29:03.770
to teach an obedient student and get paid more.

29:04.199 --> 29:05.969
Anyway, bye. I'm off.

29:06.199 --> 29:07.669
How's your grandma's health? Is she well?

29:12.810 --> 29:16.250
My gosh, Mr. Tutor. It's so good to see you.

29:16.580 --> 29:18.679
My goodness. I missed you.

29:18.780 --> 29:20.718
Welcome, Mr. Tutor.

29:20.719 --> 29:22.350
Have you been well?

29:22.419 --> 29:24.050
Yes, thanks to you.

29:24.619 --> 29:26.888
You rascal. You should've given me a heads-up...

29:26.889 --> 29:28.659
that you invited him over.

29:28.760 --> 29:31.060
I'm not happy with how the food turned out.

29:31.189 --> 29:33.398
Grandma, he lived here with us up until recently.

29:33.399 --> 29:34.659
You don't need to flaunt your cooking skills.

29:35.159 --> 29:39.129
It's not like you gave me enough time to flaunt my skills. Goodness.

29:40.570 --> 29:42.769
- Come on in. Let's go inside.
- Okay.

29:42.770 --> 29:45.408
What? My gosh. Take me too!

29:45.409 --> 29:47.510
- Come inside, you little rascal.
- What?

29:53.679 --> 29:54.719
Here.

29:55.719 --> 29:58.320
My gosh. I'm sorry there aren't many side dishes.

29:59.219 --> 30:00.820
That family must treat you very well.

30:01.090 --> 30:03.229
I heard they were very wealthy.

30:03.230 --> 30:05.830
No. I love your food the best, Ms. Go.

30:07.000 --> 30:10.000
My goodness. I know you're just trying to flatter me,

30:10.129 --> 30:11.600
but thank you very much.

30:12.530 --> 30:13.868
Please dig in.

30:13.869 --> 30:16.408
Hey, go and get some scorched rice tea.

30:16.409 --> 30:18.409
Why do we need scorched rice tea when we haven't even eaten yet?

30:19.209 --> 30:21.580
Don't ask questions. Just go and get the tea.

30:24.179 --> 30:25.449
Please dig in.

30:25.909 --> 30:27.149
You brat.

30:27.550 --> 30:29.649
Grandma, don't say absurd things to him.

30:31.990 --> 30:33.790
I want the braised short ribs. Save some for me.

30:37.159 --> 30:39.459
You know, while you were staying with us,

30:40.000 --> 30:42.800
did I make you uncomfortable or hurt your feelings?

30:44.070 --> 30:47.069
No, Ms. Go. Why are you asking me this? Not at all.

30:47.070 --> 30:49.570
You took such great care of me when I was staying here.

30:51.570 --> 30:53.639
If that's the case,

30:53.810 --> 30:55.540
would you please consider...

30:55.980 --> 30:58.480
tutoring Yi Chan again?

31:00.980 --> 31:03.119
My goodness. Please sit comfortably.

31:05.020 --> 31:06.590
You probably don't know this,

31:06.760 --> 31:09.429
but ever since he met you,

31:09.560 --> 31:11.889
he's turned over a new leaf.

31:12.659 --> 31:14.829
In the past, he ignored me when I was practically...

31:14.830 --> 31:18.469
begging him to quit his part-time job, but he's finally quit.

31:18.969 --> 31:21.699
At night, he goes to the storage room in secret...

31:21.899 --> 31:24.639
to solve math problems and memorize English words.

31:25.869 --> 31:28.139
He wants to impress you.

31:30.310 --> 31:32.878
But ever since you moved out,

31:32.879 --> 31:35.379
he's been looking a little lost.

31:36.389 --> 31:37.820
A few days ago, he said...

31:37.990 --> 31:41.419
he was going to Ma Joo's place to study for his exam or something.

31:41.459 --> 31:43.159
He didn't even come home that day.

31:43.429 --> 31:45.760
Goodness. He clearly didn't study that day.

31:46.629 --> 31:48.428
He came home...

31:48.429 --> 31:50.699
with bruises all over his face.

31:50.770 --> 31:53.439
Even so, how could you abandon Yi Chan because of me? You jerk.

31:53.699 --> 31:55.368
Yi Chan was giving out flyers to find you.

31:55.369 --> 31:56.638
That's how he got beaten up, got hit in the head,

31:56.639 --> 31:57.639
and was hospitalized too.

31:57.640 --> 32:00.439
I couldn't even ask him if he'd gotten into a fight.

32:00.980 --> 32:03.350
I'm worried he'd become a rebel and end up like his dad.

32:04.810 --> 32:06.350
Yi Chan's father? What about him?

32:10.490 --> 32:11.550
His father...

32:12.350 --> 32:14.418
was addicted to gambling.

32:14.419 --> 32:17.060
He always came to me for money...

32:18.230 --> 32:19.959
and hit me.

32:25.770 --> 32:27.040
So please...

32:27.869 --> 32:31.869
kindly consider tutoring Yi Chan again.

32:35.280 --> 32:37.148
I can't pay you as much as that family does,

32:37.149 --> 32:39.520
but I'll pay you very well too. Please?

32:42.719 --> 32:46.290
Ms. Go, I'm not staying with them because they pay me well.

32:47.719 --> 32:49.629
Then why?

32:50.030 --> 32:52.230
There's something I must do while staying with them.

32:52.760 --> 32:54.859
It's for Yi Chan's sake.

32:55.530 --> 32:59.300
I promise you that I'll come back as soon as I finish what I have to do.

33:07.540 --> 33:09.679
(Snail Guesthouse)

33:10.010 --> 33:11.679
Go back inside. I can go alone.

33:11.980 --> 33:14.350
Come on. Let's go. I don't want to get yelled at by Grandma.

33:15.619 --> 33:17.889
Oh, someone fixed this.

33:21.760 --> 33:22.830
Wait up.

33:24.790 --> 33:27.260
Hey, don't tell me you beat someone up.

33:28.659 --> 33:31.030
I didn't want to waste my energy on those jerks, so I didn't.

33:32.330 --> 33:34.639
Se Gyeong said you got into the fight because of me.

33:35.240 --> 33:36.240
Is that true?

33:36.241 --> 33:38.810
No, it wasn't because of you. Let's just blame my luck.

33:39.879 --> 33:41.379
Then what about being hospitalized?

33:42.240 --> 33:45.050
Were you hiding at Ma Joo's place not to worry Ms. Go?

33:45.780 --> 33:48.250
I heard the hospital had good food, so I went there for a few days.

33:48.379 --> 33:49.820
What? So you were actually hospitalized?

33:50.219 --> 33:52.888
Were you badly hurt? My gosh.

33:52.889 --> 33:54.789
Hey, don't overreact.

33:54.790 --> 33:56.158
As you can see, I'm totally fine.

33:56.159 --> 33:58.658
What about your ears? You didn't hurt your ears? Can you hear well?

33:58.659 --> 34:00.959
Yes, I can hear very well. You're so loud!

34:01.730 --> 34:04.500
Darn you. Why did you disappear if you were this worried?

34:05.530 --> 34:08.040
Forget it. That reminds me.

34:08.139 --> 34:10.070
Give my thanks to Yoon Chung Ah when you get home.

34:11.070 --> 34:12.239
You know Yoon Chung Ah?

34:12.240 --> 34:14.980
Not well. I think she and Se Gyeong are friends.

34:15.379 --> 34:16.850
Anyway, give her my thanks.

34:17.209 --> 34:18.679
She saved my life.

34:18.780 --> 34:21.280
Chung Ah saved your life? How?

34:21.750 --> 34:24.520
Ask her directly. I don't remember what happened.

34:25.350 --> 34:27.218
I went to see her to thank her and ask her what happened,

34:27.219 --> 34:28.420
but they kicked me out.

34:29.020 --> 34:32.659
Then how do you know that Chung Ah saved your life?

34:33.060 --> 34:34.529
Oh, Se Gyeong told me.

34:36.429 --> 34:38.798
It's Ma Joo. Bye, then.

34:38.799 --> 34:41.568
Why don't you come with me now and thank Chung Ah in person?

34:41.569 --> 34:43.210
Another time. He said to hurry.

34:43.540 --> 34:45.069
We're going to tweak the set list together.

34:45.239 --> 34:46.279
Bye.

34:47.339 --> 34:49.009
If you're late for practice, I will kill you.

34:50.549 --> 34:52.509
If you see Se Gyeong behind my back, you're so dead.

34:52.920 --> 34:55.750
Do that, and our deal's off. We won't be friends anymore. Got it?

34:58.790 --> 35:00.489
Dad got hurt because of me.

35:05.060 --> 35:06.130
Consequently,

35:06.830 --> 35:09.199
Mom saved Dad's life.

35:10.130 --> 35:12.630
Dad, how did you and Mom meet?

35:17.639 --> 35:21.110
I met her in a sign language class when I was 20.

35:22.210 --> 35:23.909
I went there to learn sign language...

35:24.080 --> 35:25.909
and fell in love with your mom the moment I saw her.

35:26.920 --> 35:29.319
At age 18, Dad didn't know Mom.

35:30.290 --> 35:31.920
But now, he knows her.

35:38.159 --> 35:40.900
Mom, who had a crush on Dad at age 18,

35:41.730 --> 35:43.468
now has a connecting link.

35:43.469 --> 35:45.270
(Bestin Rabbit Thirty Seven Ice Cream)

35:45.699 --> 35:46.770
It's me.

35:48.699 --> 35:51.969
I'm the link that can connect Mom and Dad at age 18.

35:52.569 --> 35:53.610
And...

35:53.710 --> 35:55.480
How about we don't see her at all?

35:55.980 --> 35:57.579
Let's keep it fair between us.

35:57.580 --> 35:59.549
So both of us shouldn't see her until the school festival.

36:00.619 --> 36:01.679
Deal!

36:04.850 --> 36:06.290
A chance that presented itself at an opportune time.

36:10.790 --> 36:12.729
The roadblock called Choi Se Gyeong is gone.

36:12.730 --> 36:14.259
I must not miss this chance.

36:14.830 --> 36:17.170
I must make Mom and Dad fall for each other before the festival...

36:17.429 --> 36:19.799
and find out when Dad's accident took place...

36:20.170 --> 36:22.339
so that I can prevent it, no matter what.

37:09.049 --> 37:11.790
I'm the Queen of Cello at Seowon Arts High,

37:12.290 --> 37:13.319
Choi Se Gyeong.

37:16.319 --> 37:18.459
- Choi Se Gyeong is here!
- Hey, let's go!

37:18.460 --> 37:20.500
- Oh, my.
- Hey, come on.

37:20.659 --> 37:22.429
- Let's go see her.
- My gosh.

37:27.600 --> 37:29.809
- She's really pretty.
- She's so hot!

37:29.810 --> 37:31.339
- Hey.
- Hi, Se Gyeong!

37:35.610 --> 37:36.679
Wait just one moment.

37:40.219 --> 37:41.679
Move over. I must see her!

37:43.489 --> 37:45.089
Hey, step aside.

37:52.659 --> 37:53.730
Se Gyeong.

37:54.659 --> 37:55.659
Choi Se Gyeong!

37:57.270 --> 37:58.270
Hey.

37:59.270 --> 38:00.600
You really hurt my feelings.

38:01.069 --> 38:03.940
I can't believe you never called me when you returned to Korea.

38:04.339 --> 38:06.139
I'm sorry, but who are you?

38:07.239 --> 38:08.279
Who am I?

38:08.880 --> 38:10.679
You really don't know who I am?

38:11.150 --> 38:13.819
Shoot. At this rate, they might find out on my first day that...

38:14.420 --> 38:15.619
Hey, it's me.

38:16.020 --> 38:17.790
Yoon Sang A from Seowon Arts High School.

38:18.319 --> 38:20.389
My family owned Jinsung Musical Instruments, remember?

38:22.190 --> 38:23.889
I did hear you moved back to Korea.

38:24.429 --> 38:25.889
So it was true, after all.

38:28.299 --> 38:30.869
My gosh. Is she your daughter?

38:31.230 --> 38:32.400
Hi.

38:33.770 --> 38:36.739
Oh, my. She looks just like you back in high school.

38:37.940 --> 38:40.779
Darn it. She's that chatty, slow-witted lady?

38:41.239 --> 38:43.709
My gosh. My eyes are welling up with tears.

38:43.710 --> 38:46.549
Hey, I was just kidding.

38:46.650 --> 38:48.379
You're Yoon Sang A, the daughter of the Jinsung family.

38:48.380 --> 38:50.089
Of course, I know you.

38:50.819 --> 38:52.589
How have you been, Sang A?

38:52.850 --> 38:54.619
Whatever, you meanie.

38:54.920 --> 38:56.730
I bet you didn't miss me at all.

38:57.560 --> 38:59.460
I sent you letters, but you never once wrote me back.

38:59.560 --> 39:01.400
You didn't even bother to page me when you came back.

39:01.860 --> 39:03.199
You heartless girl.

39:03.770 --> 39:05.368
Are we really best friends?

39:05.369 --> 39:07.069
Wait, hold on.

39:07.799 --> 39:10.568
You're my best friend? Not Yoon Chung Ah?

39:10.569 --> 39:11.610
Hey!

39:24.350 --> 39:26.119
I have to go to the Teachers' Office quickly.

39:26.589 --> 39:28.790
I'll probably be reprimanded for that incident.

39:29.190 --> 39:32.330
It'll be nothing serious, so don't worry too much.

39:40.469 --> 39:42.900
Don't report every single thing to me. It's annoying.

39:53.920 --> 39:55.279
(I know why you're angry. I'll help you.)

40:06.230 --> 40:08.060
I know why you're angry.

40:08.360 --> 40:09.600
I'll help you.

40:10.000 --> 40:11.569
So please forgive me.

40:11.900 --> 40:13.369
I'm always on your side.

40:19.569 --> 40:22.009
Hey, what do you need to check with Chung Ah?

40:22.509 --> 40:24.409
I swear, I am your best friend.

40:24.480 --> 40:27.219
What's going on? Why is Se Gyeong at school at this hour?

40:27.480 --> 40:29.819
Does Chung Ah know that you've now returned to school?

40:29.850 --> 40:32.319
What? She'll attend school again?

40:34.560 --> 40:35.618
What should I do?

40:35.619 --> 40:37.060
She saw me. Should I say hi?

40:37.130 --> 40:39.060
If you see Se Gyeong behind my back, you're so dead.

40:39.190 --> 40:41.960
Do that, and our deal's off. We won't be friends anymore. Got it?

40:55.239 --> 40:57.380
I'm sorry, Ms. Choi. Please forgive me.

40:58.279 --> 40:59.408
That Shiba Sky.

40:59.409 --> 41:00.549
Hey, stop right there!

41:01.819 --> 41:03.520
Sorry, move.

41:05.920 --> 41:07.159
Hey, Shiba Sky!

41:11.929 --> 41:12.929
Guys, move!

41:18.130 --> 41:19.130
Hey, Ha Yi Chan!

41:22.239 --> 41:23.569
You won't fall down like that.

41:23.810 --> 41:24.839
Hey, we've got a problem.

41:25.210 --> 41:28.179
I just checked a voicemail message from Yong Jun Ki.

41:28.380 --> 41:30.409
Se Gyeong will be going to school starting today.

41:30.580 --> 41:31.880
- What about it?
- What?

41:32.210 --> 41:33.420
- What?
- That's right.

41:33.980 --> 41:35.520
Then she'll be seeing that jerk, Ha Eun Gyeol,

41:35.920 --> 41:37.449
at school every day.

41:37.619 --> 41:39.249
Exactly.

41:39.250 --> 41:41.219
From what I heard, they're already chasing each other.

41:42.219 --> 41:45.258
Ha Eun Gyeol, that jerk. I bet he knew everything from the get-go.

41:45.259 --> 41:46.360
Hey, where are you going?

41:47.730 --> 41:48.929
The only thing I can do...

41:49.259 --> 41:50.569
is outshine him.

41:51.730 --> 41:52.730
On that note,

41:53.440 --> 41:54.839
I must practice.

41:57.069 --> 41:58.069
Let's go!

42:01.339 --> 42:02.339
What is this?

42:05.710 --> 42:06.719
What's going on here?

42:09.080 --> 42:11.049
This is the band room. What are you doing here?

42:11.250 --> 42:13.790
What? Didn't the teacher tell you?

42:14.520 --> 42:16.290
This room is ours, as of today.

42:21.860 --> 42:22.929
- Hello.
- Hello.

42:23.770 --> 42:25.069
Sir, wait!

42:25.830 --> 42:26.969
Wait.

42:27.799 --> 42:30.968
Sir, you didn't say anything about it the other day.

42:30.969 --> 42:32.068
I told you.

42:32.069 --> 42:34.209
The decision came from the Guidance Committee. I have no choice.

42:34.210 --> 42:36.139
Even so, you can't take the band room away from us!

42:36.480 --> 42:38.379
It's like telling us to disband!

42:38.380 --> 42:40.080
Bingo. I'd appreciate that.

42:40.779 --> 42:42.880
Stop. Don't go!

42:43.589 --> 42:44.849
We want the room back!

42:44.850 --> 42:46.019
You little...

42:46.020 --> 42:47.088
Let go.

42:47.089 --> 42:49.689
- My pants will get ripped!
- Wait, please.

42:49.690 --> 42:51.088
The festival is right around the corner.

42:51.089 --> 42:52.860
This really isn't fair!

42:53.060 --> 42:54.799
I'd rather have you walk all over me!

42:55.429 --> 42:56.999
Say one more word,

42:57.000 --> 42:59.330
and you guys can't perform at the festival.

42:59.830 --> 43:01.638
- No!
- Hey.

43:01.639 --> 43:03.568
- Please!
- Hey, let go.

43:03.569 --> 43:04.810
- Hey!
- Please!

43:08.639 --> 43:11.049
(19th, Jin Bo Ra)

43:12.210 --> 43:14.779
I guess we're not meant to do this band thing.

43:23.060 --> 43:25.429
Who's this jerk that's humming?

43:28.230 --> 43:29.529
Oh, boy.

43:30.230 --> 43:31.299
What can I do?

43:31.929 --> 43:33.869
My private hotel has closed its doors.

43:34.040 --> 43:36.338
So sadly, I shall look for someplace else to stay.

43:36.339 --> 43:38.139
Is that even a joke?

43:38.569 --> 43:40.609
I can't stop grimacing as I'm listening to your nonsense.

43:40.610 --> 43:42.610
You guys can follow me if you'd like.

43:44.009 --> 43:46.949
You always find hidden treasures where you fall.

43:50.949 --> 43:52.119
Let's go dig up some treasures.

43:54.889 --> 43:57.929
Submit letters of apology and volunteer at school for a week.

43:58.130 --> 44:00.400
We're doing this instead of placing you on probation, so be grateful.

44:12.469 --> 44:14.239
(Keep the door closed. Whose tail is this long?)

44:15.639 --> 44:16.909
Hey, stop right there.

44:18.549 --> 44:19.649
- Here, bye!
- Hey!

44:19.650 --> 44:20.880
What are you two doing?

44:21.580 --> 44:23.080
(Letter of Apology, Ha Eun Gyeol)

44:24.219 --> 44:26.350
That little... Hey!

44:27.190 --> 44:28.190
Hey, Ha Eun Gyeol!

44:30.589 --> 44:32.928
Were they slave hunters in their past lives?

44:32.929 --> 44:34.298
They chase each other all day long...

44:34.299 --> 44:35.860
- Hey!
- whenever their eyes meet.

44:37.569 --> 44:38.600
My gosh.

44:39.230 --> 44:41.469
Gosh, how romantic.

44:41.940 --> 44:43.540
When I catch you, I'll really...

44:44.610 --> 44:45.639
Hey!

44:49.509 --> 44:50.579
Hey, let me borrow this.

44:50.580 --> 44:52.278
What? Hey, that's not fair!

44:52.279 --> 44:53.520
Are you sure this is romantic?

44:53.850 --> 44:55.219
- She'd kill him if he got caught.
- Hey!

44:58.319 --> 45:00.190
- Hey!
- What? What is happening?

45:15.469 --> 45:17.409
Let me catch you while I'm still talking to you nicely.

45:18.509 --> 45:20.480
If you run away again, I will kill you!

45:21.009 --> 45:22.080
Hey!

45:29.880 --> 45:31.988
Because of your confession, everyone thinks we're dating.

45:31.989 --> 45:34.059
And now, you're humiliating me in front of the whole school?

45:34.060 --> 45:35.060
What am I, a virus?

45:35.061 --> 45:36.460
Why are you avoiding me? Why did you run away?

45:37.029 --> 45:38.889
Yi Chan and I made a deal...

45:39.230 --> 45:42.159
that we wouldn't see you for the time being to be fair.

45:42.460 --> 45:44.170
So? You're in self-quarantine?

45:44.270 --> 45:45.999
- Until when?
- The day of the festival.

45:46.000 --> 45:48.239
- When can you end your quarantine?
- Once the festival is over.

45:48.569 --> 45:51.210
You really are putting everything on the line for the festival.

45:52.239 --> 45:53.939
In any case, just know that.

45:53.940 --> 45:55.738
Your cooperation will be appreciated.

45:55.739 --> 45:58.008
Cooperation, my foot! Am I your toy?

45:58.009 --> 45:59.350
Who says you two can toy with me like this?

45:59.480 --> 46:01.279
- Don't get me wrong.
- Forget it.

46:02.080 --> 46:04.719
Anyway, it means that the ball is in my court now.

46:04.850 --> 46:07.118
And I can do whatever I want...

46:07.119 --> 46:08.159
with that ball, right?

46:09.119 --> 46:10.659
What will you do with it?

46:10.730 --> 46:12.159
None of your business.

46:12.259 --> 46:14.029
Go. You're free to go.

46:18.730 --> 46:19.730
I'm getting a bad feeling.

46:20.600 --> 46:21.639
I have a bad feeling about this.

46:31.509 --> 46:32.750
Hey. It's me, Ma Joo.

46:32.909 --> 46:35.080
Don't tell anyone what I'm about to tell you.

46:35.679 --> 46:36.988
We don't have access to the band room anymore.

46:36.989 --> 46:38.948
We found a new spot where we can practice.

46:38.949 --> 46:40.088
Except for the band members,

46:40.089 --> 46:42.258
no one else can know where it is.

46:42.259 --> 46:43.588
We must keep this a secret,

46:43.589 --> 46:45.830
so remember that no outsiders are allowed to visit.

46:51.900 --> 46:53.000
(Seowon Arts High School)

47:03.949 --> 47:05.579
I said I'd help you.

47:05.580 --> 47:07.020
I want to take you somewhere.

47:10.549 --> 47:11.889
(I said I'd help you. I want to take you somewhere.)

47:25.630 --> 47:26.969
I know I'm cheating,

47:27.540 --> 47:29.739
but I have no choice but to do this, so Mom and Dad end up together.

47:32.139 --> 47:33.678
I'm telling you, for real.

47:33.679 --> 47:34.939
I thought you were Lee Moon Sae.

47:34.940 --> 47:36.580
My goodness. Don't exaggerate.

47:38.080 --> 47:41.019
I tried portraying the red in the burning sunset in gradation.

47:41.020 --> 47:43.250
What do you say? Could you see it?

47:43.750 --> 47:44.850
Yes, totally.

47:45.089 --> 47:47.088
When the sunset unfolded right before my eyes,

47:47.089 --> 47:49.118
I felt as though I was seeing a sea of blood.

47:49.119 --> 47:51.190
- My gosh. It really was amazing.
- I knew it.

47:51.960 --> 47:53.359
I'm sorry, Se Gyeong.

47:53.360 --> 47:55.630
I ended up wasting my talent because of some jerk,

47:55.929 --> 47:58.369
but I promise I'll sing a serenade for you at the festival.

47:59.100 --> 48:00.130
A serenade?

48:00.369 --> 48:02.440
A serenade? No.

48:04.210 --> 48:05.710
What is going on here?

48:06.009 --> 48:07.610
Hey, you're here.

48:07.679 --> 48:09.309
- Hey.
- I thought this place was a secret,

48:09.310 --> 48:10.850
and no outsiders were allowed to enter.

48:11.779 --> 48:13.210
That's rich coming from you.

48:13.980 --> 48:16.319
- Come out for a moment.
- Oh, my. I'm so very scared.

48:16.520 --> 48:18.948
Hey, think about what you did.

48:18.949 --> 48:20.319
Why are you getting so worked up?

48:20.659 --> 48:22.588
- Come here.
- Let go!

48:22.589 --> 48:24.790
I can walk with my own legs...

48:27.600 --> 48:30.060
Hey, go!

48:31.429 --> 48:32.830
They're at it again.

48:33.569 --> 48:35.169
Ever since I met them,

48:35.170 --> 48:37.610
I've been feeling like I'm on a suspension bridge every day.

48:40.239 --> 48:41.239
Hi.

48:42.339 --> 48:43.409
Hey.

48:47.480 --> 48:48.549
She knows sign language?

48:54.790 --> 48:56.589
Hey, are you really going to do this?

48:56.690 --> 48:59.488
You promised me you wouldn't see her before the festival.

48:59.489 --> 49:00.699
You're a coward.

49:00.830 --> 49:03.158
You did that because you knew Se Gyeong was coming back to school.

49:03.159 --> 49:05.428
Hey, how many times have I told you that I had no idea?

49:05.429 --> 49:08.439
Do you know what I went through just to keep my promise?

49:08.440 --> 49:09.669
If that makes you this angry,

49:09.670 --> 49:11.669
just let yourself be the scumbag that you are...

49:11.670 --> 49:13.508
instead of lying to my face all the time.

49:13.509 --> 49:15.610
My gosh. This really is nuts.

49:16.509 --> 49:18.549
Fine, forget the promise.

49:19.179 --> 49:20.650
But can you break the rules as our front man?

49:20.980 --> 49:23.649
You guys said it was a secret, and no outsiders were allowed to enter.

49:23.650 --> 49:25.649
Look who's talking. You brought an outsider along too!

49:25.650 --> 49:27.118
I brought her along for a reason!

49:27.119 --> 49:29.758
She'll be our HMS designer.

49:29.759 --> 49:31.428
Whatever. What is "HMS?"

49:31.429 --> 49:32.488
Hair, makeup, style!

49:32.489 --> 49:35.428
Goodness. Do you think I brought Se Gyeong along for no reason?

49:35.429 --> 49:37.368
I politely recruited her.

49:37.369 --> 49:39.068
As our official photographer, who will make...

49:39.069 --> 49:41.899
all our promotional posters, pamphlets, and even music videos.

49:41.900 --> 49:42.900
PPM!

49:43.369 --> 49:44.939
Only because you like her.

49:44.940 --> 49:46.508
We don't even know if she can do those things.

49:46.509 --> 49:48.709
You brought Chung Ah because you have a personal agenda.

49:48.710 --> 49:50.678
You want to win points with the girl you're tutoring!

49:50.679 --> 49:52.479
You haven't seen Chung Ah's drawings, have you?

49:52.480 --> 49:55.979
Chung Ah can design stages, costumes, and posters.

49:55.980 --> 49:58.588
She's a multitalented artist who can do everything!

49:58.589 --> 50:01.360
You haven't seen the photos Se Gyeong took at the amusement park.

50:01.489 --> 50:03.928
My Se Gyeong is pretty and uber-talented.

50:03.929 --> 50:05.860
She's a woman of many talents. What's your problem?

50:06.330 --> 50:07.400
You little...

50:10.469 --> 50:11.529
Have you eaten yet?

50:12.230 --> 50:14.198
Se Gyeong, you know sign language?

50:14.199 --> 50:15.900
Oh, just a little.

50:17.270 --> 50:18.669
I really am not that good.

50:18.670 --> 50:19.710
When did you learn it?

50:20.040 --> 50:22.479
My deaf friend taught me briefly a few years back,

50:22.480 --> 50:24.149
but I really am not good.

50:24.150 --> 50:26.209
Don't say that. You are good.

50:26.210 --> 50:28.349
What did you mean earlier? When you did this.

50:28.350 --> 50:30.080
Earlier? Oh, that.

50:30.350 --> 50:33.150
"Don't go. Stay with me."

50:35.520 --> 50:37.629
- Oh, my.
- No, I'm embarrassed.

50:37.630 --> 50:39.758
- You're good.
- You're a pro.

50:39.759 --> 50:41.059
Your compliments are making me blush.

50:41.060 --> 50:42.959
- Why is she so nice today?
- Hey, go home.

50:42.960 --> 50:44.868
- Me?
- I can't stand you. Leave.

50:44.869 --> 50:45.928
I don't like you either.

50:45.929 --> 50:47.440
Se Gyeong, spare me a moment.

50:48.440 --> 50:49.440
That little...

50:50.400 --> 50:51.670
What do you think you're doing?

50:51.839 --> 50:53.238
You said to check if she could do the job.

50:53.239 --> 50:54.810
I heard you'd be our photographer.

50:55.409 --> 50:57.909
I recommended Chung Ah as our designer.

50:58.380 --> 51:00.779
Yi Chan and I will have to cross-check your skills.

51:00.880 --> 51:03.048
I hope you cooperate and take the test to prove your skills.

51:03.049 --> 51:05.088
Yes, sure thing. I shall cooperate.

51:05.089 --> 51:06.750
Let's go. Do you just need me to take some pictures?

51:08.219 --> 51:10.258
Se Gyeong. Hey!

51:10.259 --> 51:12.290
Hey, you must think the world revolves around you!

51:12.360 --> 51:14.429
- Darn it!
- Clearly, we can't practice today.

51:15.130 --> 51:16.159
Hey.

51:16.659 --> 51:18.730
Page me once you guys are done with the skills test.

51:19.000 --> 51:20.170
Let's go play some video games.

51:21.569 --> 51:23.739
Gosh, do we need a shamanic ritual or something?

51:25.639 --> 51:27.779
Hey, page us.

51:29.040 --> 51:30.110
Darn it.

51:42.460 --> 51:43.588
Wait up, will you?

51:43.589 --> 51:45.690
What will you do if I don't follow you?

51:46.730 --> 51:47.730
That's yours, right?

51:48.500 --> 51:51.068
Why? Do I have to prove my driving skills too?

51:51.069 --> 51:53.299
No, I'll drive. Hand over the keys.

51:53.900 --> 51:54.939
Where are we going?

51:54.940 --> 51:56.969
We'll get a disposable camera and go to an outdoor spot.

51:57.040 --> 51:59.639
I've already picked a good location to shoot our music video.

52:00.040 --> 52:02.880
You'll take pictures, and I'll verify your skills.

52:03.409 --> 52:04.480
Deal?

52:05.350 --> 52:06.479
I shall make...

52:06.480 --> 52:07.979
this one sacrifice for Yi Chan,

52:07.980 --> 52:09.920
who is pouring his heart and soul into the band.

52:10.319 --> 52:11.319
Here.

52:28.100 --> 52:29.170
Hi.

52:33.170 --> 52:36.009
Oh, right. Well...

52:36.909 --> 52:38.980
The other day,

52:40.210 --> 52:41.250
you...

52:42.449 --> 52:44.989
saved me. Thank you for that.

52:45.819 --> 52:46.819
He's using sign language again?

52:47.389 --> 52:49.060
And I'm sorry.

52:49.889 --> 52:51.529
I didn't know...

52:53.029 --> 52:55.460
that you were the one who saved me.

52:57.500 --> 52:59.199
Also...

53:00.569 --> 53:02.469
Oh, I didn't practice this one.

53:09.639 --> 53:10.750
Shall we look at your drawings now?

53:14.750 --> 53:17.019
Hey, how far are we going?

53:17.020 --> 53:18.149
We're almost there!

53:18.150 --> 53:19.588
You should've just picked somewhere close.

53:19.589 --> 53:21.059
Why do we have to go so far?

53:21.060 --> 53:22.089
What do you think?

53:22.219 --> 53:24.860
I'm doing this so Mom and Dad can spend some time together, alone.

53:27.529 --> 53:29.299
What's wrong? Why did you stop?

53:34.500 --> 53:36.869
We've run out of gas.

53:37.069 --> 53:38.069
What?

53:38.070 --> 53:40.710
Darn you. I'm so annoyed!

53:44.380 --> 53:45.380
Oh, my.

53:46.409 --> 53:47.520
My gosh.

53:49.420 --> 53:50.420
Nice.

53:52.619 --> 53:53.619
This is awesome.

54:10.170 --> 54:11.239
Oh.

54:15.310 --> 54:16.440
Darn it, seriously.

54:19.179 --> 54:20.449
Hey.

54:21.080 --> 54:22.548
Why don't we leave the scooter here...

54:22.549 --> 54:23.778
and go to the main road?

54:23.779 --> 54:24.889
We can still catch the last bus.

54:25.350 --> 54:26.689
It's not yours, so you don't care?

54:26.690 --> 54:29.389
We can't hitchhike with the scooter.

54:29.790 --> 54:32.459
I promise you that I'll pick it up and bring it to you tomorrow.

54:32.460 --> 54:35.000
Honestly, you really are...

54:37.400 --> 54:39.299
- What?
- What?

54:39.799 --> 54:42.499
- Oh, here!
- Stop!

54:42.500 --> 54:44.138
- Sir! Help us just this once!
- Just this once!

54:44.139 --> 54:46.270
- Please, stop!
- Please!

55:09.400 --> 55:11.230
Why are you doing all this, really?

55:11.569 --> 55:12.600
What do you mean?

55:13.330 --> 55:14.900
You don't even like me.

55:15.400 --> 55:17.170
What are you talking about? I do like you.

55:17.339 --> 55:19.909
My gosh. You couldn't have sounded more insincere.

55:20.040 --> 55:22.178
Forget it. I can't talk to you.

55:22.179 --> 55:23.738
(Bus)

55:23.739 --> 55:24.810
What about you?

55:25.650 --> 55:26.678
You said you'd do whatever you wanted with the ball.

55:26.679 --> 55:27.679
So this was it?

55:28.350 --> 55:30.119
Throwing it to Yi Chan once,

55:30.179 --> 55:31.889
and then once to me?

55:32.020 --> 55:34.659
You guys will play it fair while toying with me, but I can't?

55:35.060 --> 55:37.118
I want to be fair to you both too.

55:37.119 --> 55:39.888
I'll play with the ball until the day of the festival,

55:39.889 --> 55:41.230
in a fair manner.

55:50.770 --> 55:51.909
You know...

55:53.710 --> 55:54.779
About that ball.

55:58.009 --> 55:59.810
Can you throw the ball only to me?

56:02.219 --> 56:04.319
I'm very confident that I can catch it well.

56:06.949 --> 56:08.960
Even if I get hit by the ball because you threw it carelessly,

56:10.319 --> 56:11.589
I'll be fine.

56:12.759 --> 56:14.830
I'm confident I won't lose the ball even if I'm in pain.

56:15.860 --> 56:17.529
I know I won't let anyone take it from me,

56:18.429 --> 56:20.600
and I'm confident I'd get it back even if I were to lose it.

56:25.639 --> 56:27.409
So can you throw it only to me?

56:31.150 --> 56:32.150
What's your answer?

56:35.619 --> 56:37.850
Sing for me, and I'll think about it.

56:38.489 --> 56:41.360
Here, all of a sudden? That's random.

56:41.489 --> 56:42.619
Forget it if you don't want to do it.

56:42.719 --> 56:44.560
But Yi Chan would totally sing for me.

56:45.190 --> 56:48.029
He will sing a serenade for me at the festival.

56:48.259 --> 56:51.900
Would you know my name

56:54.299 --> 56:57.540
If I saw you in heaven

57:00.239 --> 57:04.080
Would it be the same

57:06.250 --> 57:09.520
If I saw you in heaven

57:12.619 --> 57:16.259
I must be strong

57:18.659 --> 57:21.500
And carry on

57:21.860 --> 57:27.429
Because I know I don't belong

57:28.339 --> 57:30.270
Here in heaven

57:58.130 --> 57:59.469
Suddenly, it hit me.

58:01.569 --> 58:03.670
The spring of 1995.

58:06.069 --> 58:08.040
Just like Mom and Dad,

58:10.009 --> 58:11.380
I was also 18.

59:08.839 --> 59:13.710
(Twinkling Watermelon)

59:14.170 --> 59:16.540
Can we be friends?

59:16.710 --> 59:19.210
Do you like me?

59:20.509 --> 59:22.519
Then please tell me when my dad's accident took place.

59:22.520 --> 59:24.448
Actually, I found and sent...

59:24.449 --> 59:26.289
the perfect helper for you.

59:26.290 --> 59:28.520
"Helper?" Who's that?

59:28.619 --> 59:30.189
Is Yoon Dong Jin the "helper?"

59:30.190 --> 59:32.658
I believe the contract you signed with the chairman is for a month.

59:32.659 --> 59:34.258
You'd better leave before that.

59:34.259 --> 59:35.399
I need to know how I can go back...

59:35.400 --> 59:37.659
to decide whether or not to go back.

59:38.029 --> 59:40.568
Hey, can you spare me a moment?

59:40.569 --> 59:43.400
Sorry. I shouldn't have let myself fall for you. I made a mistake.

59:43.934 --> 59:45.734
Dramaday.me
